cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Predicting the 24-2 visual field from a single SD-OCT session"
abstract: >-
  Research code for predicting 52 pointwise Humphrey 24-2 threshold
  sensitivities from one SD-OCT session, combining a convolutional branch over
  Cirrus thickness maps with a gradient-boosted branch over report summary
  parameters by late fusion with a single scalar weight fitted within each
  cross-validation fold.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/bigbases/oct-vf-prediction"
